        <caption>
          <formatted-text>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>This stacked bar chart represents quarterly sales distribution across different years. It shows that sales vary across quarters, with Q4 generally contributing higher sales compared to other quarters. The color segmentation highlights year-wise contribution within each quarter.</run>
