          </formatted-text>
        </title>
        <caption>
          <formatted-text>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>This heatmap represents the yearly sales distribution using color intensity. Darker shades indicate higher sales, while lighter shades represent lower sales. The year 2022 shows the highest sales, whereas 2025 has the lowest, highlighting variations in performance across years.</run>
          </formatted-text>
        </caption>
      </layout-options>
      <table>
