          <formatted-text>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>This continuous area chart illustrates the yearly sales trend using a filled representation. Sales increased steadily from 2020 to 2022, reaching a peak in 2022, followed by a gradual decline in subsequent years. A sharp drop is observed in 2025, which may indicate significant decrease in performance.</run>
